  "body": "\r\nI am trying to emulate what the Atmel Android native app is doing to communicate.\r\nAfter writing to a characteristic the client (Android device) notify the server (Atmel MCU).\r\nHowever I can't find any similar function in the Bluetooth web API.\r\n\r\nhttps://developer.android.com/reference/android/bluetooth/BluetoothGattServer.html\r\n**notifyCharacteristicChanged**\r\nThis function is called in the Android app.\r\n\r\nI tried to write to the characteristic with writeValue, but this is not enough. The device need the notification.",
